		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Stunt Rally]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=36111#p36111"><![CDATA[
Stunt Rally started from using VDrift simulation in 2010, which already used Bullet.<br>It mainly features rally racing cars on gravel roads and tracks with various stunts<br>(jumps, loops, pipes, obstacles, dynamic objects, water, mud).<br><br>Recently it also included simple hovering spaceships and a bouncing sphere.<br>Current version on master has now also a simple bike and a 6 wheeled vehicle WIP.<br><br>Everything including wiki, downloads, gallery, videos and more is on our website:<br><a href="http://stuntrally.tuxfamily.org/" class="postlink">http://stuntrally.tuxfamily.org/</a><br><br>Have fun.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=11450">CryHam</a> — Fri Aug 21, 2015 6:55 am</p><hr />
